  Number of Transport printed output locations (NTOA)...   80
  Number of Tabular Flow Splitters in Transport (NTSP)..   50
  Number of Elements in the Extran Block (NEE).......... 5000
  Number of Pumps in Extran (NEP).......................  800
  Number of Orifices in Extran (NEO).................... 1000
  Number of Tide Gates/Free Outfalls in Extran (NTG).... 1000
  Number of Extran Weirs (NEW).......................... 2000
  Number of Extran Printout Locations (NPO).............10000
  Number of Tide Elements in Extran (NTE)............... 1000
  Number of Natural Channels (NNC)...................... 1000
  Number of Storage Junctions in Extran (NVSE).......... 1000
  Number of Time History Data Points in Extran (NTVAL).. 1200
